{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-rimal-3","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"rimal-3-dubai-investments-dubai-marina","about":"Rimal 3 is one of the buildings in the Rimal cluster, located on the first coastline in the new Jumeirah Beach Residence neighborhood. The 40-storey building, surrounded by hotels, retail outlets and restaurants, offers residential studio apartments, 1-3 bedroom apartments, as well as hotel rooms with first—class amenities. The apartment has air conditioning and heating, built-in wardrobes, modern finishes, equipped kitchen, laundry room, access to Wi-Fi and cable TV, balcony. Some rooms have all the necessary furniture. The windows offer beautiful views of the sea, the marina and the city panorama. The infrastructure includes a private beach and a beach club, a beautiful landscaped garden, swimming pools for adults and children (open all year round), restaurants and bars, a spa and wellness center, a fitness center, laundry, concierge services, 24-hour security and much more. On the private territory there are children's and sports grounds, recreation and walking areas. Pets are allowed in the complex.There are shops and supermarkets, entertainment and cultural venues, tourist spots and a shopping center within walking distance. The proximity to the Sheikh Zayed Road motorway allows you to quickly reach any area of Dubai. Bus stops and metro stations are within walking distance. The international airport is a 30-minute drive away.JBR Beach Public Beach is a 2-minute walk from the complex.","price":1850000,"title":"Rimal 3","bitrix":{"id":624,"pf_id":"are.3.3682","source":null,"project_id":"Rimal","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Rimal 3","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Dubai Investments","project_location":"Jumeirah Beach Residence"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1606/images/2024/04/09/340x252/